---
import DocLayout from '../../layouts/DocLayout.astro';
---

<DocLayout title="Docs" description="Farn design system documentation — foundations, tokens, components">
  <h1>Documentation</h1>
  <p>
    Farn is a CSS custom-property design system — token-first, framework-agnostic, built for
    brand, websites, and web apps. No build step, no runtime. One CSS file and you're set.
  </p>
  <p>
    Building a site? Start with <a href="/docs/getting-started">Getting Started</a> for
    the CDN link, font setup, and FOWT prevention.
    Designing components? Jump to <a href="/docs/foundations/color">Foundations</a>
    for token reference, then <a href="/docs/components">Components</a> for specs.
  </p>

  <div class="docs-grid">
    <a href="/docs/getting-started" class="docs-card">
      <div class="docs-card-icon"><i class="ti ti-rocket"></i></div>
      <h2 class="docs-card-title">Getting Started</h2>
      <p class="docs-card-desc">Install Farn, load fonts, prevent FOWT, and set up dark/light mode in your project.</p>
      <span class="docs-card-cta">Read guide →</span>
    </a>
    <a href="/docs/foundations/color" class="docs-card">
      <div class="docs-card-icon"><i class="ti ti-palette"></i></div>
      <h2 class="docs-card-title">Foundations</h2>
      <p class="docs-card-desc">Color palettes, typography tokens, spacing scale, border radius, and z-index reference.</p>
      <span class="docs-card-cta">Explore tokens →</span>
    </a>
    <a href="/docs/components" class="docs-card">
      <div class="docs-card-icon"><i class="ti ti-components"></i></div>
      <h2 class="docs-card-title">Components</h2>
      <p class="docs-card-desc">Buttons, cards, forms, navigation, and badges — spec'd for light and dark surfaces.</p>
      <span class="docs-card-cta">View components →</span>
    </a>
    <a href="/about" class="docs-card docs-card-about">
      <div class="docs-card-icon"><i class="ti ti-leaf"></i></div>
      <h2 class="docs-card-title">About Farn</h2>
      <p class="docs-card-desc">The design philosophy, aesthetic direction, and principles behind the system.</p>
      <span class="docs-card-cta">Learn more →</span>
    </a>
  </div>

  <h2>What Farn Includes</h2>
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>Layer</th><th>File</th><th>What it provides</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>Palette</td><td><code>colors.css</code></td><td>17 raw colour tokens across four named palettes</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Typography</td><td><code>typography.css</code></td><td><code>--font-display</code>, <code>--font-body</code>, <code>--font-mono</code></td></tr>
      <tr><td>Spacing</td><td><code>spacing.css</code></td><td>Space scale, layout widths, border radius, z-index</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Semantic</td><td><code>dark-light.css</code></td><td>Semantic tokens + <code>data-surface</code> overrides</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Base</td><td><code>base.css</code></td><td>Box-sizing reset, focus ring, reduced-motion</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <p>All five layers ship as a single <code>dist/farn.css</code> via CDN — one <code>&lt;link&gt;</code> tag loads everything.</p>
</DocLayout>

<style>
  .docs-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-md);
    margin: var(--space-xl) 0 var(--space-2xl);
    max-width: var(--width-prose);
  }

  .docs-card {
    background: var(--color-bg-elevated);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: var(--space-lg);
    text-decoration: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-xs);
    transition: background-color 150ms ease, border-color 150ms ease, box-shadow 150ms ease;
  }
  .docs-card:hover {
    background: var(--color-bg-sunken);
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--color-accent);
  }

  .docs-card-icon {
    width: 36px; height: 36px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    background: rgba(62,122,98,0.1);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-size: 20px;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  [data-theme="dark"] .docs-card-icon { background: rgba(92,158,134,0.15); }

  .docs-card-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 18;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .docs-card-desc {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
    max-width: none;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .docs-card-cta {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    margin-top: var(--space-xs);
  }
</style>
